@HealthAssistant.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5124

### Stream a chat answer
POST {{HealthAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/plain

{
  "message": "What are the key points in the company health guidance?",
  "history": []
}

### Index a PDF or DOCX (replace ./guidance.pdf with a local file)
POST {{HealthAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WellnestBoundary

------WellnestBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="guidance.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./guidance.pdf
------WellnestBoundary--
